                "text": "60 years ago today, the Head Start program was created to provide early childhood education, health, nutrition, and parent involvement services to low-income children and families. Trump and Republicans in Congress are cutting Head Start programs. Supporting families means supporting access to affordable, quality childcare. Anything less harms our kids, their parents, and our economy. We must protect this valuable program from the Trump Administration\u2019s plans to eliminate it. \n \nhttps://t.co/jX9KXbDsjt",
